{"sourceUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/6973.htm","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.389761+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/info/1035/6973.htm","html":"<div><div>\n<p><strong><span><span><br/></span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>为做好</span>2026<span>年</span></span><span><span>我院</span></span><span><span>硕士研究生预推免考核工作</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>现将有关事项通知</span></span><span><span>如下：</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>一、组织机构</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.<span>学院研究生招生工作领导小组</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>  <span>长：</span></span><span><span>熊</span></span>  <span><span>炜</span> <span>、王慷慨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>王宽松</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>    <span>员：</span></span><span><span>各</span></span><span><span>系所招生工作负责人</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.<span>学院研究生招生思想政治表现考核小组 </span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>    <span>长：</span></span><span><span>王慷慨</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>副组长：</span></span><span><span>冯</span></span>  <span><span>虹</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>组</span>    <span>员：</span></span><span><span>各</span></span><span><span>招生系所党支部书记</span></span><span><span>、面试专家</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>二、考核对象</span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span><span>由学院招生工作专家组从已经通过</span><span>“</span><span>中南大学推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><a href=\"https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>https://yjszsgl.csu.edu.cn/zsgl2026/tmsgl/default.aspx</span></a><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>网上报名</span></span><span><span>（</span></span><strong><span><span>报名请在</span>2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日前完成</span></span></strong><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>且已提供了资格审查材料</span></span><strong><span><span>（提交要求见后面说明）</span></span></strong><span><span>的学生中进行</span></span><span><span>选拔</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>经招生工作领导小组审核通过</span></span><span><span>后</span></span><strong><span><span>预计</span></span></strong><strong><span>2025<span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>1</span></span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>前</span></span></strong><span><span>公布</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>凡有意参加我院预推免考核的学生请扫码加入微信群。</span></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://jcyxy.csu.edu.cn/__local/E/75/F4/24539DFE6BCB0B1E5ABA3634C6A_C3BB2CE8_245A2.png\"/></span></span></span></p>\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><br/></td>\n<td><br/></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p> <strong><span><span>三、工作原则</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span>1</span><span>.</span><span><span>坚持</span><span>“</span><span>按需招生、德智体全面衡量、择优录取、宁缺毋滥</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span>2</span><span>.</span><span><span>坚持公平、公正、公开的原则。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>四、考核工作安排</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span>1.<span>资格审查</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>已在</span></span><span><span>“</span><span>中南大学推免生服务系统</span><span>”</span></span><span><span>完成</span></span><span><span>网上报名</span></span><span><span>的同学请在</span></span><strong><span>2025<span>年</span><span>9</span><span>月</span><span>9</span><span>日</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>前</span></span></strong><span><span>提供资格审查材料扫描件</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>扫描件要求：将以下材料扫描整合成一个</span>PDF<span>文件并用</span><span>“</span></span><strong><span><span>报考研究方向</span>+<span>姓名</span><span>”</span></span></strong><span><span>命名（例如：人体解剖学</span>+<span>张三）发送邮箱</span></span><strong><span>315024625@qq.com<span>。</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>1</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>个人简历</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>2</span><span><span>）居民身份证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>3</span><span><span>）学生证</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>4</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>本科学习期间成绩单</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>（需加盖毕业院校教务部门或档案部门章）</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>5</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>最高等级的</span></span><span><span>英语水平测试证书</span></span><span><span>扫描</span></span><span><span>件</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>（</span></span><span>6</span><span><span>）</span></span><span><span>各项能证明自己学业水平的论文和</span></span><span><span>获奖情况等</span></span><span><span>扫描件</span></span><span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>2.<span>考核方式、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>时间、地点</span> </span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>考核方式：线下面试</span></span><span><span>；</span></span></p>\n<p><span><span>考核时间地点：</span></span><strong><span>2025<span>年</span></span></strong><strong><span>9<span>月</span><span>16</span><span>日</span><span>-17</span><span>日</span></span></strong><span><span>，具体考核时间和地点另行通知。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>3.</span></strong><strong><span><span>考核内容</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span>1<span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>思想政治表现考核</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>思想政治表现考核等级为</span><span>“</span><span>合格</span><span>”</span><span>和</span><span>“</span><span>不合格</span><span>”</span><span>，不合格不予</span></span><span><span>预</span></span><span><span>录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span>2</span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>专业基础测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>专业基础测试</span></span><span><span>采取抽题问答或随机问答方式</span></span><span><span>，</span><span>满分为</span>100<span>分</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>60<span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span>3</span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span></span><span><span>采取随机问答方式</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>满分为</span>100<span>分</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>60<span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>（</span></span></strong><strong><span>4</span></strong><strong><span><span>）</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>外语能力测试</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>外语</span></span><span><span>能力</span></span><span><span>测试</span></span><span><span>采取</span></span><span><span>笔试或</span></span><span><span>听说交流</span></span><span><span>方式</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>满分为</span>100<span>分</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span>60<span>分合格，不合格不予预录取。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>4.</span></strong><strong><span><span>总成绩计算</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>总成绩</span>=<span>专业基础测试</span><span>+</span><span>综合素质及能力测试</span></span><span>+</span><span><span>外语能力测试。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span>5.<span>录取说明</span></span></strong></p>\n<p><span><span>申请人取得</span></span><span><span>正式</span></span><span><span>推免资格后</span></span><span><span>在教育部规定时间内</span></span><span><span>登录教育部全国推免服务系统</span></span><span><span>进行</span></span><span><span>报名，</span></span><span><span>并</span></span><span><span>完成填报志愿，</span></span><span><span>我</span></span><span><span>院</span></span><span><span>将根据</span></span><span><span>推免录取</span></span><span><span>实际情况</span></span><span><span>择优</span></span><span><span>发送复试通知，学生</span></span><span><span>接受复试确认、接受待录取确认</span></span><span><span>后</span></span><span><span>，</span></span><span><span>方可正式完成推免录取。</span></span><span><span>推免服务系统开放时间请关注中国研究生招生信息网相关公告。</span></span></p>\n<p><strong><span><span>五</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>、</span></span></strong><strong><span><span>联系方式</span></span></strong><strong> </strong></p>\n<p><span><span>联系人：</span></span><span><span>易老师</span></span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>电话：</span>0731-</span><span>88660440</span><span><span>；</span></span><span><span>邮箱：</span>315024625@qq.com<span>；地址：中南大学杏林校区孝骞楼</span><span>709</span><span>。</span></span></p>\n<p> </p>\n</div></div>","textSha256":"6aa11169eb6ef4ab49e165eca759f19a63361795552831c06cc75c3f9ab8dc19","textLength":1125,"sourceSha256":"035770fcae7fee619cecb455318d1e1ec33a104c7a45bb319fbcaa283b681f25","selector":"#vsb_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-1dc70da264e7bf3292bb","title":"2025年中南大学湘雅基础医学院2026年硕士研究生预推免考核工作通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T17:00:04.389761+00:00"}
